    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brophy Estates are delighted to present Apartment 5 Castle Oaks to the market, a particularly spacious and well-proportioned two-bedroom, two-bathroom ground-floor apartment extending to approximately 89 m², ideally located within this gated, mature, and highly regarded Malahide development.\r\nOne of the standout features of No. 5 is the generous scale of the accommodation. At approximately 89 m², the apartment offers an excellent sense of space throughout, with well-proportioned living and bedroom accommodation ideally suited to comfortable modern living. While the property would benefit from some modernisation, it presents an excellent opportunity for a purchaser to create a comfortable contemporary home tailored to their own taste.\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway leading to a bright and spacious living/dining area, with access to the patio area, providing valuable private outdoor space and an attractive extension of the living accommodation during the warmer months. The kitchen is conveniently positioned off the main living space.\r\nThere are two generously sized bedrooms, including a main bedroom with en-suite bathroom, together with a separate main bathroom. The ground-floor position also provides ease of access, making the property particularly appealing to a broad range of purchasers, including first-time buyers, downsizers and those seeking a convenient Malahide base.\r\nCastle Oaks enjoys an excellent location, combining a peaceful residential setting with convenient access to everything Malahide has to offer. Malahide Village is within easy reach, with its excellent selection of restaurants, cafés, boutiques, and everyday amenities, together with Malahide DART Station, and the beautiful grounds of Malahide Castle and Demesne are only a 2 minute away away.\r\nThe property is also ideally positioned for access to Dublin Airport, the M1 and M50, while a wide selection of sporting and recreational facilities are available throughout the surrounding area.\r\nWith its combination of generous 89 m² accommodation, two double bedrooms, two bathrooms, ground-floor accessibility, and private patio area, Apartment 5 Castle Oaks represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious apartment in one of Malahide's established residential developments.\r\nManagement fee approx €3420"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation:\r\nFoyer 3.73m x 2.59m\r\nHall 1.90m x 0.98m\r\nLiving Room 7.62mx 4.22m\r\nKitchen / Diner 4.84m x 4.33m\r\nMain Bathroom 2.38m x 1.97m\r\nMain Bedroom 2.97m x 5.29m\r\nEn-suite 1.58m x 1.75m\r\nStorage 1.24m x 1.97m"
      },
